Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:26:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] feat(calls): colored call outcomes, call-log export,
 faster contact pick
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Call history shows a phone icon + direction arrow colored by outcome:
  green = connected (answered, duration > 0), red = not connected /
  missed / rejected, amber = voicemail, gray = blocked/unknown
- CallLog.Outcome / IsConnected; 'Outgoing · not connected' label
- Export call history to Documents\\Sefirah\\call-log.json and .csv
  (outcome, connected, duration, number, contact) 2 s after changes,
  written atomically, for external stats automation
- Number box hint 'Num or search'; Enter/Tab take the highlighted or
  first matching contact, arrow keys select the highlighted contact

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
